# Parakeet ASR model weights: uploaded directly to Hostinger via SFTP, not
# through git (well over GitHub's 100MB per-file push limit). The Hostinger
# webhook does a `git pull` in place, so these untracked files persist on the
# server across deploys as long as they're never committed here.
